{"sourceUrl":"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2026/0701/c12332a395614/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.761774+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/2026/0701/c12332a395614/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>为促进优秀大学生之间的学术交流，加强全国大学生对哈尔滨工业大学物理学院的了解，我院将于</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>下旬</span></span><span><span>举办学术交流营活动。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>一、申请资格</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党领导，愿为祖国建设服务，身心健康，诚实守信，学风端正。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>就读但不限于物理学等相关专业的</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>届高水平研究型大学优秀本科生，对物理学学科有浓厚兴趣，有志于从事物理</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>学科的研究工作。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>具有较强学术研究能力的理工科报名者优先考虑（如在学术研究、学科竞赛、创新发明等方面表现优秀，并提交</span></span><span><span>翔实</span></span><span><span>的证明材料）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>二、申请流程</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>点击以下链接或扫码填写报名信息，请确认无误后提交，报名链接：</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/tS5MSam.aspx</span></span><span><span><span><span>，报名二维码如下</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://physics.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/39/a5/8fe65ef64f078fc12c1053fde6b9/c0668414-381b-4ccf-9b79-1f279dd040a4.png\"/></p><p><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日—</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>1.</strong></span></span><span><strong>申请材料</strong></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）个人简历、学生证；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的最新成绩排名证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的最新成绩单；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>）体现英语水平的证明材料（国家英语四、六级，</span></span><span>TOEFL</span><span><span>成绩、</span></span><span>GRE</span><span><span>成绩等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）其他证明材料，包括：已发表论文，应提供全文；本科期间各类获奖证书。</span></span></p><p><span><span>请申请人将以上材料电子版原件或扫描件按顺序合成一个</span></span><span>PDF</span><span><span>文件，文件命名为“姓名</span></span><span>+</span><span><span>本科学校”上传至报名链接中。相关材料原件将在入营时进行审查。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>2.</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>营员选拔</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院将根据申请者的报名信息，择优确定入营者名单，并以邮件或电话等方式通知，</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>日前未接到通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>三、活动安排</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>时间：</span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月下旬（具体时间另行通知）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>地点：哈尔滨工业大学校本部一校区</span></span></span></p><p><span>活动内容：</span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>）开营式</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）学科前沿报告</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）参观学习、学术交流</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）其他活动</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>其他说明：</span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>学校将为营员提供交流营期间在哈尔滨的食宿。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>营员报到后要求全程参加学术交流营活动。</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span>具体日程会根据实际情况进行调整。</span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span><span>具体政策以学校当年的文件为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>四、联系方式</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：<span>赵</span>老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span>0451-864<span>14109</span></span></p><p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><span><span>zhaojingyu321</span>@126.com</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>哈尔滨工业大学物理学院</span></span></span></p><p><span>2026</span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span>7</span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span>1</span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"386f0967fb03b4dc5111320f4701f8caa3d0958d216992b38a9f532105e2cb29","textLength":855,"sourceSha256":"983edaa671b3a5eabd30b6c5ca4203a35b8bb4914e78305ccb4dfe6cdc925631","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d8afb5d28ddfa5620ee4","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学物理学院2026年未来物理学术交流营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.761774+00:00"}
